  "title": "Capri Holdings Limited Announces Participation in the Morgan Stanley Global Consumer and Retail Conference",
  "summary": "Capri Holdings Limited (NYSE:CPRI), a global fashion luxury group, today announced that John D. Idol, Chairman and Chief Executive Officer, and Rajal Mehta, Interim Chief Financial Officer, will be participating in a fireside chat at the Morgan Stanley Global Consumer and Retail Conference, held at the InterContinental New York Barclay Hotel in New York City, on Wednesday, December 3, 2025, at 11:00 AM Eastern Time. The event will be webcast live on the Company's Investor Relations website, www.",
